/v1/","context":{"app_id":4348260,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-4348260","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T08:40:46Z","value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4547170","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4348260-1846651706692091","game_id":"steam-4348260","kind":"announcement","title":"DOPROS is at Steam Next Fest: October 2026 Edition","summary":"Greetings, law-abiding citizens! DOPROS is a part of Steam Next Fest: October 2026 Edition, such a great reason to play the demo, if you haven't already! The Demo will bring you:A special game condition: the Interrogator is annoyed by the late shift, and that accelerates the story’s pace and makes almost any answer crucial.3 types of persuasion technique checks (AKA mini-games).Branching plot and 5 different endings, which will give you a hint at what is going on in the grim DOPROS reality. Are ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T18:14:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692091","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4348260-1846018067934077","game_id":"steam-4348260","kind":"announcement","title":"DOPROS IS A PUNK GAME!","summary":"Yo punks!We are having an absolute blast being a part of the Punk Games Showcase. We totally dig the vibe of the event, and the games there are so freaking awesome. You really should give it a look!And yeah, don't forget to play DOPROS. The Late Shift, this demo-prequel is waiting for you to dip in and show the system who's who, or, at least, try to. Fight the system, be stunning!The Witches Circle Team","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T17:01:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067934077","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4348260-1844751498218330","game_id":"steam-4348260","kind":"announcement","title":"PLAY THE DEMO","summary":"Greetings, law-abiding citizens! We are thrilled to invite you to play demo-prequel DOPROS. The Late Shift! The demo introduces you to the annoyed Officer 983, whose shift has been lasting for quite some time. The officer has the case KPI to fulfil, but you have a chance to talk your way out of here.Are you to walk free from this interrogation? Find out right now! DOPROS. The Late Shift offers you a piece of the main game experience together with: Special game condition that accelerates the narr","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-23T12:53:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498218330","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4348260-1842846814456045","game_id":"steam-4348260","kind":"announcement","title":"Closed Playtest is On!","summary":"Greetings, law-abiding citizens!We are happy to announce that, before the demo-prequel DOPROS. The Late Shift release next week, we are holding a closed playtest. Just push the playtest button to let us know you wanna in :)The Late Shift is a narrative-driven interrogation simulator and a showcase of swift totalitarian justice. The demo introduces you to the annoyed Officer 983, whose shift has been lasting for quite some time. The officer has the case KPI to fulfil, but you have a chance to tal","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-08T15:39:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814456045","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4348260-1839041357036314","game_id":"steam-4348260","kind":"announcement","title":"DOPROS Will Have a DEMO | Monochropoly 2026 Official Selection","summary":"Greetings, law-abiding citizens!We are thrilled to drop two cool announcements. First of all, DOPROS is an Official Selection of the Monochropoly 2026 event on Steam. Check out dozens of cool, stylish games :)The second awesome news is that DOPROS will have a free demo-prequel called The Late Shift. That is a tiny slice of the main game with its own story and pacing, which will give you a hint at what is going on in the grim DOPROS reality; that information could be handy in the main game. The P","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-27T17:09:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357036314","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4348260-1831432155571106","game_id":"steam-4348260","kind":"announcement","title":"Inside DOPROS. Part I: Avoid","summary":"Greetings, law-abiding citizens! We want to give you a little dip into the game’s mechanics and tell you how they are intertwined with the main theme and philosophy. That’s gonna be a series of brief posts about different aspects of DOPROS. And today, we will tell you about the mini-games idea in general, and the Avoid segment in particular.Mini-games appear when the player has to answer some tricky questions. For example, when you reject an \"opportunity\" to confess, the Interagator goes, \"Are y","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-01T12:00:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155571106","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4348260-1828441623112137","game_id":"steam-4348260","kind":"announcement","title":"The Announcement Trailer Bloopers","summary":"Greetings, law-abiding citizens!Today, we have something incredibly silly for you — a bloopers clip from our Announcement Trailer set. We hope it's going to cheer you up :)Don't forget to like, subscribe, and wishlist the game!Best potions, The Witches Circle","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-31T13:01:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1828441623112137","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4348260-1827626365765491","game_id":"steam-4348260","kind":"announcement","title":"The Announcement of DOPROS","summary":"Greetings, law-abiding citizens!We are awed to announce DOPROS, a dark Orwell-inspired interrogation experience with a branching plot wherein you play not as a detective or officer but as a regular folk.Make your own protagonist as your answers will shape them as a person with their own views and attitude.Act differently to find the right approach, or fail and face the consequences of your choices in a variety of different outcomes.Use one of the randomly picked persuasion techniques (mini-games","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-24T12:01:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1827626365765491","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4348260":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:11:46Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T02:11:46Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt